WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:11.549
"How do we find June?" Pip asks.

2
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:16.922
Jane sticks her dot on the rose tile.

3
00:00:16.923 --> 00:00:24.974
"I did this last time," she says.

4
00:00:24.975 --> 00:00:29.399
But the sprite does not come.

5
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:36.979
Pip sighs. "Now what?"

6
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:44.242
Jane tries again.

7
00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:49.792
"You did not do it right!" Pip cries.

8
00:00:49.793 --> 00:00:52.510
Jane makes a face.

9
00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:59.124
"I bet you can't do it."

10
00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:13.324
Gran comes in. "Kids, don't fight."

11
00:01:13.325 --> 00:01:17.298
"Sorry, Gran," Pip says.

12
00:01:17.299 --> 00:01:22.534
Jane looks down. "Me too."

13
00:01:22.535 --> 00:01:31.982
Just then Gran sways.

14
00:01:31.983 --> 00:01:37.083
"Gran, are you all right?" Jane asks.

15
00:01:37.084 --> 00:01:40.786
"I feel odd," Gran replies.

16
00:01:40.787 --> 00:01:47.022
"I need to lie down."

17
00:01:47.023 --> 00:02:01.348
Gran goes to take a nap.

18
00:02:01.349 --> 00:02:07.626
"We need to find June," Pip says.

19
00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:12.000
Jane grabs the map. "I will find her."

20
00:02:12.001 --> 00:02:16.834
"Stop! You had two tries," Pip says.

21
00:02:16.835 --> 00:02:18.912
"Let me do it now."

22
00:02:18.913 --> 00:02:28.506
He grabs the map too.

23
00:02:28.507 --> 00:02:35.024
"Let go! You will rip it!" Jane cries.

24
00:02:35.025 --> 00:02:40.153
Bam! There's a bright flash of light.

25
00:02:40.154 --> 00:02:45.890
Pip jumps. "What a fright!"

26
00:02:45.891 --> 00:02:51.289
Then June flies out!

